{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33029","headline":"夜坐有怀 · 曹邺","name":"夜坐有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悄悄月出树，东南若微霜。\n愁人不成寐，五月夜亦长。\n佳期杳天末，骨肉不在旁。\n年华且有恨，厥体难久康。\n人言力耕者，岁旱亦有粮。\n吾道固如此，安得苦伥伥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}